        "html": "<h1>Status meeting</h1><p>⭐ Next week's meeting has been moved to <strong>Wednesday</strong>.</p><p>❓ What are the exact dates for the conference?</p><p>Upcoming training opportunities. See Katie for more info.</p><p>Around the room updates.</p><ul><li>❗ Design handouts</li><li>❗ Plan keynote</li></ul><ul class=\"checklist\"><li class=\"checklist-item checklist-item-checked\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"checklist-checkbox\" checked=\"checked\"> <span class=\"checklist-text\">Till garden bed</span></li><li class=\"checklist-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"checklist-checkbox\"> <span class=\"checklist-text\">Plant peas and spinach</span></li><li class=\"checklist-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"checklist-checkbox\"> <span class=\"checklist-text\">Plant tomatoes and peppers</span></li></ul><ul><li>An item with a Project A note tag</li><li>An item with a Project A note tag</li></ul><br><ul><li style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">💡 An item with an Idea note tag</li><li style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">❓ An item with a Question note tag</li></ul><ul class=\"checklist\"><li class=\"checklist-item checklist-item-checked\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"checklist-checkbox\" checked=\"checked\"> <span class=\"checklist-text\">Two note tags:  project-a, client-request:completed</span></li></ul><p>💡❓ Three note tags:  idea, send-in-email, question</p><ol><li>Erster Schritt</li></ol><ul class=\"checklist\"><li class=\"checklist-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"checklist-checkbox\"> <span class=\"checklist-text\">Wichtig erledigen</span></li><li class=\"checklist-item checklist-item-checked\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"checklist-checkbox\" checked=\"checked\"> <span class=\"checklist-text\">Schon erledigt</span></li></ul><ol start=\"4\" style=\"counter-reset: item 3;\"><li>Letzter Schritt</li></ol><p>⭐ Next time, <strong>don't</strong> forget to invite <span style=\"background-color: yellow;\">Dan</span>.</p>",
